  "statement": "Compute \\(\\frac{\\tan ^{2}\\left(20^{\\circ}\\right)-\\sin ^{2}\\left(20^{\\circ}\\right)}{\\tan ^{2}\\left(20^{\\circ}\\right) \\sin ^{2}\\left(20^{\\circ}\\right)}\\).",
